  "content": "\n\n<p>這個可選的整合模組為 <strong>Curios on NeoForge</strong> 提供了支援，為以下 Refined Storage 工具提供兩個專屬的 Curios 插槽：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252frefinedmods.com%252frefined-storage%252fwireless-networking%252fwireless-grid.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">無線網格</a>  </li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252frefinedmods.com%252frefined-storage%252fwireless-networking%252fcreative-wireless-grid.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">創造無線網格</a>  </li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252frefinedmods.com%252frefined-storage%252fwireless-networking%252fwireless-crafting-grid.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">無線合成網格</a>  </li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252frefinedmods.com%252frefined-storage%252fwireless-networking%252fcreative-wireless-crafting-grid.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">創造無線合成網格</a>  </li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252frefinedmods.com%252frefined-storage%252fviewing-resources%252fportable-grid.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">攜帶型網格</a>  </li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252frefinedmods.com%252frefined-storage%252fviewing-resources%252fcreative-portable-grid.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">創造攜帶型網格</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>您可以將其與快捷鍵綁定搭配使用，以便在裝備時快速開啟這些工具。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://refinedmods.com/curios.1faca87d.png\" alt=\"Curios 插槽\"></p>",
